# College data must never live in the repo (PII, and this repo is public).
# Marksheets arrive as PDFs at least as often as spreadsheets -- there were four
# of them sitting untracked in a working directory when this line was added, one
# `git add -A` away from being public forever.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.pdf
